WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.613 line:8%
Open the student's profile and confirm their reference and identity before making a correction.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:11.596 line:8%
Enter the verified identifier in Correct NIC and give a clear reason.

00:00:11.596 --> 00:00:15.745 line:8%
A conflicting NIC must be investigated rather than merged automatically.

00:00:16.756 --> 00:00:19.739 line:8%
Save and check the masked identifier.

00:00:19.739 --> 00:00:24.214 line:8%
Leave Correct NIC blank when changing only contact information.
